========================================
PART 2 — THE MODEL AND ITS CHECKPOINT
========================================

7. What ored50m Is

RUN

cd C:\Users\username\artz\ored\model
python scripts\pretrain.py --describe

OUTPUT

"n_layer": 13,
"d_model": 512,
"n_head": 8,
"d_ff": 2048,
"block_size": 1024,
"vocab_size": 16384,
"parameters": 49894912,

It trains only on the big corpus stored in Cloudflare R2 (PART 4), never on the
rows in Supabase. Supabase only keeps the record of which dataset exists.

---

8. The Checkpoint: best.pt Only

checkpoints\
└── ored50m\
    ├── best.pt
    └── history.json

best.pt       = the epoch with the lowest validation loss. The ONLY checkpoint.
history.json  = loss of every epoch (numbers only, not a checkpoint)

After every epoch:

better validation loss → best.pt is replaced
worse validation loss  → nothing is saved

There is no base.pt, no live.pt, no history\ folder, no epoch_001.pt.

In R2 (step 21) it is:

ored-ai/checkpoints/ored50m/best.pt

