========================================
PART 3 — KEYS
========================================

9. Set Your R2 Keys

Do this in EVERY new Command Prompt window, after step 3:

RUN

set ORED_R2_ACCOUNT_ID=YOUR_ACCOUNT_ID
set ORED_R2_ACCESS_KEY_ID=YOUR_ACCESS_KEY_ID
set ORED_R2_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=YOUR_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY
set ORED_R2_BUCKET=YOUR_BUCKET_NAME

Get them from:

Cloudflare → R2 → Manage API tokens → Create API token (Object Read & Write)

No quotes around the values.
"set" only lasts for this window. That is on purpose.

«Never put these keys in GitHub, in a file in artz, or in the website.»

---

10. Set Your Supabase Keys

Do this in EVERY new Command Prompt window, after step 3:

RUN

set ORED_SB_URL=https://xoauguhlxjozpvukjtro.supabase.co
set ORED_SB_SERVICE_KEY=YOUR_SECRET_KEY

Get YOUR_SECRET_KEY from:

Supabase → Ored.ai project → Project Settings → API Keys → Secret key
(it starts with sb_secret_)

«Never put the secret key in GitHub, in a file in artz, or in the website.»

